  <name>Watch Health</name>
  <summary>See the health data of your watch</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Watch Health shows the data that Amazfish downloads from your smartwatch,
      on a Phosh phone and on the desktop. It reads Amazfish's database
      and never changes it; it needs no account and no network.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Today at a glance: steps, resting heart rate, sleep, stress, heart rate variability, blood oxygen, skin temperature and PAI</li>
      <li>Every value by day, week, month and year</li>
      <li>Your own normal range instead of population averages</li>
      <li>Workouts with their numbers and the heart rate during them</li>
      <li>Follows every sync of Amazfish by itself</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Watch Health is an independent project and not affiliated with the
      Amazfish project or the watch maker. It is not a medical device.
    </p>
  </description>
